{"id": "70117", "title": "情生意动", "author": "随侯珠", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70117/70117s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70117.htm", "intro": "当一个人出现在你生命里，这一定是特别的缘分……\r\n    有一次他在厨房做饭的时候，强制拉她过来参观自己最居家的一面，她忍不住问了句：“我当初是怎么答应跟你结婚的？”\r\n    “你说咱们都是律师，以后离婚了谁也不会吃亏。”\r\n    “但如果是其他男人，我完全可以让他净身出户啊？”\r\n    “问题是别的男人，你能看上么？”\r\n   怎样的情窦初开，只看见你；怎样的情难自禁，只想着你；怎样的情生意动，只和你白首不离。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70117", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "10843491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10843492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10843493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10843494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10843495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10843496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10843497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10843498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10843499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10843500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10843501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10843502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10843503.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10843504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "10843505.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "10843506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "10843507.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "10843508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "10843509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "10843510.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "10843511.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "10843512.html", "available": true}, {"title": "23-26", "file": "10843513.html", "available": true}, {"tit